zlib 1.3.1, statically linked into gitprompt.exe.

Vendored rather than fetched at build time so the build needs nothing but a
compiler.  Built from an unmodified zlib-1.3.1 source drop with:

    mingw32-make -f win32/Makefile.gcc

which produced libz.a.  zlib.h and zconf.h are copied verbatim from that
drop; only libz.a is a build product.

zlib is (c) Jean-loup Gailly and Mark Adler, under the zlib licence -- see
the upstream distribution for the full text.
